t, break it, and tell us everything. Dates: Steam Next Fest — October 19-26, 2026. The demo stays up through the festival. What's in the demo The demo is the entire Prologue — a few hours of hacking inside a simulated desktop OS. You are Null. An encrypte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T11:13:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4380090-1843481262698519","game_id":"steam-4380090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — A New Opening","summary":"The demo now opens the way it was always meant to. Start a new game and you land in a short cinematic sequence before you ever touch the desktop: who Meridian are, what happened to Nightfall, and the transmission that puts you on the job. Relay introduces himself properly this time — he's the one who'll be watching your back for the rest of it. New A full cinematic opening — the story, the walk-in, and two incoming transmissions Subtitles on by default, with a readable transcript Skip controls a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T23:24:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698519","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4380090-1843481262691004","game_id":"steam-4380090","kind":"announcement","title":"The Official Trailer is here","summary":"The Official Trailer is here Two minutes, and for the first time it explains what this is actually about. What you're looking at Every desktop shot in this trailer is real footage from a live build. The terminal is a real terminal. The nmap output is what the game prints. The SQL injection at 1:22 is the actual foothold in the Prologue — you find the legacy login yourself, you read the page source, you spot the unsanitised query, and you write the payload. There is no minigame standing in for it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T03:27:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691004","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4380090-1839676055897338","game_id":"steam-4380090","kind":"announcement","title":"The Project Daybreak Demo Is Live","summary":"THE DEMO IS LIVE \"They said they archived Project Daybreak. They buried the name next to Nightfall and called it dead. It isn't. It never was. We've set you up with a way in — a contractor cover, a relayed inbox, a foothold on their network. The rest is on you, Null. Get in quiet. Get out quieter. And whatever you do… don't let it see you.\" — relay@darkmesh.io HACK A MEGACORP. FOR REAL. FOR FREE. The free demo for HELLO HACKER 2: PROJECT DAYBREAK is out now — and it's the game's complete Prologu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T13:02:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897338","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4380090-1839041357028099","game_id":"steam-4380090","kind":"announcement","title":"GO DARK — The Project Daybreak Demo Arrives Soon","summary":"// INCOMING TRANSMISSION — SOURCE: relay@darkmesh.io \"Meridian says they shut Project Daybreak down. They buried the name next to Nightfall and called it archived. It isn't. It never was. We set you up with a way in — a contractor cover, a relayed inbox, a foothold on their network. The rest is on you, Null. Get in quiet. Get out quieter. And whatever you do… don't let it see you.\" HELLO HACKER 2: PROJECT DAYBREAK — THE FREE DEMO ARRIVES SOON You are Null. A dead-drop lands in an inbox that was ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T00:20:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357028099","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4380090-1830797770229566","game_id":"steam-4380090","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #1 — What We're Building and Where We're At","summary":"Dev Update #1 — What We're Building and Where We're At Hey everyone — thanks for wishlisting Project Daybreak. Whether you found us through Hello Hacker or stumbled on the store page, I appreciate you being here this early. I want to use these updates to be straight with you about what the game is, how it's being built, and what the road to launch actually looks like. No hype, no fake screenshots of features that don't exist. Just honest progress. So here's where things stand. What exists right ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-22T01:21:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770229566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4380090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4380090":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4380090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z"},"5001800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:39Z"}},"context_snapshots":[